      Entry: 1
      Data: 'VRChat uses the same ExactGun for both hands, so a left hand holds it
        like a right hand (pins on the outside). When set, picking up left-handed
        turns this root upside down about the grip''s forward axis: the real left-handed
        grip, thumb on the lever, pins on the inside at the bottom.'
